    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 09 - Arabic-English Translator Bot with QA\nA Telegram translator built for business content.\n\n- Auto direction: Arabic → English, anything else → Arabic. Commands: `/en`, `/ar`, `/casual`, `/help`.\n- Uses your own **glossary** from Google Sheets so brand and technical terms are always translated the same way.\n- A second AI pass **reviews** every translation (accuracy, omissions, glossary) and scores it 1-10; weak translations are improved automatically before sending.\n- Long texts are split to fit Telegram; usage is logged.\n\n**Sheet `Translation Glossary`:** tab `Glossary` (Arabic, English, Note) and tab `Log`.",
